GRAPH <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Position_ReactionDeliveryBundlingAndBatchingBoundary> {
  <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Position_ReactionDeliveryBundlingAndBatchingBoundary> a narr:Digest ;
    narr:digestOf <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_ReactionDeliveryBundlingAndBatchingBoundary> ;
    narr:childCount "16"^^xsd:integer ;
    narr:generatedFrom "015ac8d149ff5357653f9309b2c5caed5c50ac87" ;
    narr:narration """This position holds that [reactions route through one bundle per run per person, not one message per skill](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_2), restated as a [directive establishing reaction delivery policy](narr:Expr_3DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_2) and again in [the same routing rule, re-voiced](narr:Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_2) and [the ruling directive on bundling reaction delivery](narr:Expr_20260924_2_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_haec961429483_2). The window is bounded by [the bundle closing when the run closes, with a late skill waiting for the next run rather than sending on its own](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_3), narrated in [the pushback and ruling on the batching window](narr:Expr_3DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_3), [the editorial narrative of the held position](narr:Expr_20260924_2_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_haec961429483_3), and [the boundary held against pushback](narr:Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_3). The boundary was chosen against a [rejected alternative of per-skill delivery with client-side collapsing](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_4), reported on each day in [the rejected architectural alternative](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_5), [the report of the rejected alternative](narr:Expr_3DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_4), [the editorial summary of the rejected alternative](narr:Expr_20260924_2_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_haec961429483_4), and [the rejected alternative, re-reported](narr:Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_4). The member expressions were performed in an antithesis-and-parallelism register — the ruling names what it is not before what it is.""" ;
    narr:reaction """The position itself did not move — the same three claims (the [routing rule](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_2), the [run-close boundary](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_3), the [rejected alternative](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_4)) still carry it. What is new is a further re-voicing of all three in [a later restatement of the routing rule](narr:Expr_20260926_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_ha66ee8b3c008_2), [the pushback and resolution, re-summarized](narr:Expr_20260926_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_ha66ee8b3c008_3), and [the rejected alternative, re-summarized](narr:Expr_20260926_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_ha66ee8b3c008_4) — the position is being restated, not revised, which reads as consolidation rather than drift. One nuance sharpened: the pushback children consistently carry the authority-ranking signal as relayed, so the dissent is known only through the ruler's rendering.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_2> ;
